": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56123, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0166nzwYk3qU7x2iyNp2PJLE", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 58416, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RRmmSX7F5hVj6zeGFpxSm6", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 58716, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RRmmSX7F5hVj6zeGFpxSm6", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 58716, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RRmmSX7F5hVj6zeGFpxSm6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64655, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The release list isn't in deploy order, but by sequence number v2.3.0 came before v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, and both of those are unhealthy.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1. I tried again once and it worked.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. That means the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the attempt that stopped partway) and two follow-ups: finding the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and looking into the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018fJyUEjh9uU2CyptVNxQc7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012MirfHuGQvMngkq4v4KRwN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0188HLuSvuZRNk6P1JAQnTrs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XRPCZqC1WR4oJxZ2Vv5QjK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway. Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011DewrFpkoryD6zVw2ozkVC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GZAeFkxnx1ZJthkpggS9xw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SLC3CyF5zKHPUL2cVTmsQx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents"