opped after us-east with an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1. I tried again once and it worked.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. That means the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the attempt that stopped partway) and two follow-ups: finding the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and looking into the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}